WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.466 --> 00:00:04.466
We made it to Lumiose City.

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:07.800
The last time I was here, I didn’t have much time to look around,

3
00:00:07.866 --> 00:00:10.700
but this city must be the center of the fashion universe.

4
00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:12.799
All the people are so well dressed.

5
00:00:12.866 --> 00:00:17.633
- And Prism Tower is just incredible.
- Yeah. It sure is.

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.066
I guess it’s okay.

7
00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:22.000
The Lumiose Gym is inside that tower.

8
00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:24.566
Oh, so you’ve already challenged that Gym, huh, Ash?

9
00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:27.833
- Well, I showed up there and tried to.
- Pika.

10
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.900
I really want to have a Gym battle, please.

11
00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:33.433
In order to challenge the Lumiose Gym,

12
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:37.600
you must have accumulated at least four Gym badges.

13
00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:41.333
- Oh! Hey, give me a break. Wait a minute!
- Please leave immediately.

14
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.633
Argh!

15
00:00:42.699 --> 00:00:45.199
That’s what happened. I didn’t have four badges,

16
00:00:45.266 --> 00:00:47.133
- so I couldn’t get in.
- Pikachu!

17
00:00:47.199 --> 00:00:49.800
I had no idea there were Gyms where you need four badges

18
00:00:49.866 --> 00:00:51.466
just to be able to challenge them.

19
00:00:51.533 --> 00:00:55.033
Well, since that’s the way it is here, why don’t we get out of Lumiose City?

20
00:00:55.099 --> 00:00:56.266
Let’s go.

21
00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.900
But I’ve been looking forward to exploring Lumiose City.

22
00:00:58.966 --> 00:01:02.266
We can do that stuff next time. Okay, let’s go.

23
00:01:03.433 --> 00:01:07.000
- What are we in such a rush for?
- Well, if it isn’t my Clemont and Bonnie.

24
00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:09.066
- Dad.
- Ampharos.

25
00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:11.666
- Huh? Dad?
- Pika.

26
00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:12.933
Hey.

27
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.899
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

28
00:01:15.966 --> 00:01:19.566
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

29
00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:22.333
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

30
00:01:22.399 --> 00:01:25.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

31
00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:28.233
♪ Pokémon, got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

32
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.500
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

33
00:01:31.566 --> 00:01:34.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

34
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

35
00:01:37.433 --> 00:01:39.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

36
00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon ♪

37
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.899
On their way to Cyllage City,

38
00:01:54.966 --> 00:01:58.933
our heroes have made a brief stop at Lumiose City.

39
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.866
Uh, let me introduce you.

40
00:02:00.933 --> 00:02:02.933
I want you to meet our daddy.

41
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:07.399
I’m Meyer. I run an electronics shop in this city along with Ampharos here.

42
00:02:07.466 --> 00:02:09.933
-You and Ampharos. Cool.

43
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.033
Pika! Pika!

44
00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:14.366
And these guys here, they’re our brand new, super nice, good friends.

45
00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:17.733
Your friends?

46
00:02:17.799 --> 00:02:18.666
Huh?

47
00:02:18.733 --> 00:02:21.866
I’m so... I’m so overcome with happiness!

48
00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:24.466
- I can’t tell you! Thank you all so much.
- Ah!

49
00:02:24.533 --> 00:02:27.666
My name’s Ash and this is my partner, Pikachu.

50
00:02:27.733 --> 00:02:28.866
Pikachu.

51
00:02:28.933 --> 00:02:31.900
Oh, Pikachu, nice looking electric cheeks.

52
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:36.500
- Huh! Who’s this young lady?
- I’m Serena.

53
00:02:36.566 --> 00:02:40.666
Oh. So Clemont’s finally found himself a beautiful girlfriend.

54
00:02:40.733 --> 00:02:44.966
- Got to keep an eye on you. Huh? Huh?
- Uh, Dad, it’s not like that.

55
00:02:45.033 --> 00:02:48.133
Daddy, this is Dedenne. It’s my new friend.

56
00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.866
- Na-na-na!
- So you’re an Electric type as well.

57
00:02:51.933 --> 00:02:53.766
- Now you listen to me, son.
- Oh, huh.

58
00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:56.133
You should come to the house once in a while.

59
00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.100
- But, Dad, you see, huh--
- What?

60
00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:00.366
Is there some reason you haven’t come around?

61
00:03:00.433 --> 00:03:03.066
- Oh!
- Well, Daddy, we’ve got things to do.

62
00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:06.400
- So bye for now.
- Wait, Clemont.

63
00:03:06.466 --> 00:03:08.466
I’ve told you this before.

64
00:03:08.533 --> 00:03:11.133
It’s true you need to be tough on challengers,

65
00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.966
but that alone isn’t going to help them become better Trainers.

66
00:03:14.033 --> 00:03:17.566
You need to be a Gym Leader the Lumiose Gym can be proud of.

67
00:03:17.633 --> 00:03:19.566
-Lumiose Gym?

68
00:03:19.633 --> 00:03:22.100
Gym Leader?

69
00:03:22.166 --> 00:03:24.866
- See you soon.
- Yes. All right, sir.

70
00:03:24.933 --> 00:03:28.433
Ash, Serena, please take care of my kids for me.

71
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.133
And don't forget. Come visit my shop later.

72
00:03:36.133 --> 00:03:38.466
All right, what’s this all about?

73
00:03:38.533 --> 00:03:40.833
- You see, it’s like this..
- Uh...

74
00:03:40.899 --> 00:03:43.500
Well, we might as well just tell them the truth.

75
00:03:43.566 --> 00:03:44.833
Hm.

76
00:03:45.933 --> 00:03:51.433
The truth is... that I really am the Gym Leader of the Lumiose Gym.

77
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.299
Why didn’t you just tell us?

78
00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:57.333
The thing is, I really was planning on telling you eventually.

79
00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:00.566
I’m sorry. It’s a long story.

80
00:04:00.633 --> 00:04:03.500
I was so busy as a Gym Leader.

81
00:04:03.566 --> 00:04:06.700
I never had the time to invent things like I wanted to.

82
00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:11.533
So I decided to construct a Gym Leader robot,

83
00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:16.399
who could help me fulfill my Gym Leader responsibilities and give me more time.

84
00:04:17.733 --> 00:04:21.399
Okay. All done. Now for the next step, programming.

85
00:04:21.466 --> 00:04:24.233
The first thing to do is gather up my ideals

86
00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.900
and then input them all into your AI.

87
00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:31.466
I want all challengers to have won around four Gym badges

88
00:04:31.533 --> 00:04:33.833
and you need to be kind to the challengers,

89
00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:37.033
but at the same time, you need to be tough when necessary.

90
00:04:38.833 --> 00:04:44.500
Now, I just need to set the voice code. Anything is fine, so, uh, sandwich.

91
00:04:44.566 --> 00:04:46.200
Clemont.

92
00:04:46.266 --> 00:04:48.166
Hurry up. You’ve got a challenger waiting.

93
00:04:48.233 --> 00:04:51.300
I’ll be right there.

94
00:04:52.366 --> 00:04:54.533
Huh. Oh, no, Clembot.

95
00:04:54.599 --> 00:04:56.766
What’d you make now?

96
00:04:57.766 --> 00:04:59.766
You can start today.

97
00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:05.366
I’m Clemont, the Gym Leader and you’re Clembot, the Gym Leader robot.

98
00:05:07.599 --> 00:05:10.599
Wow! I want to see it move.

99
00:05:10.666 --> 00:05:14.500
Sure. First I’ll engage it in a Pokémon battle.

100
00:05:14.566 --> 00:05:17.033
Clembot, activate.

101
00:05:17.099 --> 00:05:19.033
Welcome to the Lumiose Gym.

102
00:05:19.099 --> 00:05:21.566
I’d like to challenge you to a Gym battle.

103
00:05:21.633 --> 00:05:23.933
- How many badges do you have?
- Huh?

104
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.333
Well, I don’t have any badges.

105
00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.533
None? In order to challenge the Lumiose City Gym,

106
00:05:29.599 --> 00:05:32.200
you are required to have a minimum of four Gym badges.

107
00:05:32.266 --> 00:05:33.966
-Huh, what?

108
00:05:34.033 --> 00:05:37.166
Your programming should say you’d prefer four Gym badges.

109
00:05:37.233 --> 00:05:38.800
Please try again later.

110
00:05:38.866 --> 00:05:42.133
Stop this! I’ll just have to reprogram you instead.

111
00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.700
Can you really do that?

112
00:05:43.766 --> 00:05:46.533
I prepared a special mechanism in case of emergency.

113
00:05:46.599 --> 00:05:50.500
Now, Clembot, activate master recognition battle mode.

114
00:05:50.566 --> 00:05:53.266
Voice code will be needed for activation.

115
00:05:53.333 --> 00:05:56.133
If I remember correctly, it was sandwich.

116
00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.633
-No. You’re wrong.

117
00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.933
- What? It’s sandwich. You’re wrong!
- Incorrect.

118
00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.400
-Hey, Clemont!

119
00:06:02.466 --> 00:06:05.400
Is there any other way to get your robot to behave?

120
00:06:05.466 --> 00:06:08.599
- I don’t know.
- Please try again later.

121
00:06:16.766 --> 00:06:20.633
- Huh?
- Hey. Clembot. Come on, open up!

122
00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.866
Clembot!

123
00:06:22.933 --> 00:06:24.433
And that’s why.

124
00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.799
So now you can’t get back into your own Gym.

125
00:06:26.866 --> 00:06:29.566
I keep on trying, but Clembot won’t let anybody

126
00:06:29.633 --> 00:06:31.799
without four Gym badges through the entrance

127
00:06:31.866 --> 00:06:34.266
and he’s always out there on the battlefield.

128
00:06:35.733 --> 00:06:39.099
Hey. Why don’t we go back there together and see what we can do?

129
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:41.700
- Pika. Pika.
- Yeah. Good idea.

130
00:06:41.766 --> 00:06:43.766
Huh. Sure.

131
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.133
What a rip-off. This is crazy.

132
00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.666
Is there something wrong?

133
00:06:53.733 --> 00:06:56.033
You bet there is. It’s this Gym.

134
00:06:56.099 --> 00:06:58.700
Did they say you need four badges to challenge?

135
00:06:58.766 --> 00:07:02.633
Yeah, but that wasn’t any problem because I already had four of them.

136
00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.833
My opponent was this crazed, powerful robot.

137
00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:09.733
After I lost, it zapped me, the floor opened up and I was thrown out of there.

138
00:07:11.233 --> 00:07:14.733
- I’ve had enough of this place.
- I’ll never come to this Gym again.

139
00:07:14.799 --> 00:07:19.200
Being tough alone won’t help Trainers get better.

140
00:07:19.266 --> 00:07:21.799
Now I understand what Daddy was talking about.

141
00:07:21.866 --> 00:07:22.933
Na-na!

142
00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.666
- What will you do?
- Uh...

143
00:07:24.733 --> 00:07:26.400
- We know what to do!
- Huh?

144
00:07:26.466 --> 00:07:29.833
- We’ll just stop that crazy robot now.
- But how?

145
00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:31.799
We can’t do a thing without the voice code.

146
00:07:31.866 --> 00:07:34.566
Now try to relax and think carefully.

147
00:07:34.633 --> 00:07:38.166
Even if I remember the password, I still have to defeat it in battle.

148
00:07:38.233 --> 00:07:40.433
But you won’t know unless you give it a try.

149
00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:45.500
No way! Clembot will have all of my Pokémon partners to battle me with.

150
00:07:45.566 --> 00:07:47.866
I can’t win with my inexperienced Bunnelby.

151
00:07:47.933 --> 00:07:50.799
Well, maybe you can’t win, but you can give it your best shot.

152
00:07:50.866 --> 00:07:54.366
- Huh?
- I don’t know much about robots,

153
00:07:54.433 --> 00:07:57.933
but since you made Clembot in the first place, maybe you’ll come

154
00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.366
- to understand each other in battle.
- Pika. Pika.

155
00:08:00.433 --> 00:08:03.566
Battling Clembot to understand each other.

156
00:08:03.633 --> 00:08:06.500
Clemont, why did you become a Gym Leader in the first place?

157
00:08:06.566 --> 00:08:09.566
- Not sure how to explain.
- I’ll tell them.

158
00:08:09.633 --> 00:08:14.133
In Lumiose City, they call my brother the boy genius of Electric types.

159
00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.166
I wanted to be an Electric-type Trainer like the world had never seen,

160
00:08:18.233 --> 00:08:20.200
so I became the Lumiose Gym Leader.

161
00:08:20.266 --> 00:08:22.000
By running an Electric-type Gym,

162
00:08:22.066 --> 00:08:24.533
challengers would plan their strategies accordingly.

163
00:08:24.599 --> 00:08:28.166
I figured if I could still win in spite of the stiff competition,

164
00:08:28.233 --> 00:08:32.133
perhaps it would make me grow a lot stronger as an Electric-type Trainer.

165
00:08:33.133 --> 00:08:36.133
All the more reason why you need to get your Gym back.

166
00:08:36.199 --> 00:08:37.366
- Huh?
- She’s right.

167
00:08:37.433 --> 00:08:41.133
Taking back this Gym is going to help you grow stronger. And we’ll help.

168
00:08:41.199 --> 00:08:46.533
Hm! You’re right! Let’s go and see Clembot.

169
00:08:48.199 --> 00:08:49.699
- Hey, Clemont?
- Huh?

170
00:08:49.766 --> 00:08:53.266
Isn’t it awesome that Ash and Serena are here?

171
00:08:53.333 --> 00:08:55.333
Yeah.

172
00:08:56.333 --> 00:08:59.933
If we can get to the battlefield, we might be recognized as challengers.

173
00:09:00.066 --> 00:09:01.833
Pikachu, Iron Tail.

174
00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.199
Pika! Pika!

175
00:09:04.266 --> 00:09:06.266
Okay, follow me.

176
00:09:14.766 --> 00:09:16.100
Huh?

177
00:09:16.166 --> 00:09:19.533
We don’t have much farther to go before we get to the battlefield.

178
00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.300
- Let’s hurry up.
- Magnemite!

179
00:09:22.366 --> 00:09:25.166
- Magnemite.
- That’s my Pokémon.

180
00:09:25.233 --> 00:09:27.199
Magnemite, it’s me.

181
00:09:27.266 --> 00:09:29.100
Magnemite!

182
00:09:32.133 --> 00:09:36.100
- Come on, Magnemite, stop.
- Magnemite!

183
00:09:36.166 --> 00:09:39.433
Why is it attacking us? It’s your Pokémon, isn’t it?

184
00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:42.500
Yeah, but because Clembot is now the Gym Leader,

185
00:09:42.566 --> 00:09:45.466
I would guess it ordered Magnemite to get rid of any intruders.

186
00:09:45.533 --> 00:09:48.400
- That’s awful.
- Is it okay if we battle back?

187
00:09:48.466 --> 00:09:52.566
- We have no choice.
- Froakie, I choose you.

188
00:09:52.633 --> 00:09:53.566
Fro!

189
00:09:53.633 --> 00:09:56.066
Use your Frubbles to stop it from attacking.

190
00:09:56.133 --> 00:09:58.833
Froakie!

191
00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.266
Magnemite!

192
00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:02.199
All right. Great, Froakie.

193
00:10:02.266 --> 00:10:05.066
Ash, over here. A Magneton!

194
00:10:05.133 --> 00:10:07.900
Yeah, that Magneton’s mine, too.

195
00:10:07.966 --> 00:10:09.800
Magneton!

196
00:10:09.866 --> 00:10:13.400
- Oh!
- Oh! Fennekin, help us with Ember.

197
00:10:13.466 --> 00:10:16.633
Fennekin!

198
00:10:16.699 --> 00:10:18.100
It dodged it.

199
00:10:18.166 --> 00:10:19.433
Magneton!

200
00:10:21.199 --> 00:10:23.500
Froakie!

201
00:10:25.466 --> 00:10:28.500
Thanks so much, Pikachu and Froakie.

202
00:10:35.166 --> 00:10:38.300
Somehow, we finally made it.

203
00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:43.066
Welcome to the Lumiose Gym.

204
00:10:47.066 --> 00:10:49.933
Clembot, it’s you!

205
00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.533
Who’s that Pokémon?

206
00:10:57.266 --> 00:10:59.566
It’s Heliolisk.

207
00:11:04.933 --> 00:11:09.333
Now, Clembot, activate master recognition battle mode.

208
00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:12.733
First, voice code will be needed for recognition activation.

209
00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.633
Relax. Stay calm.

210
00:11:15.699 --> 00:11:17.366
Do it, Clemont.

211
00:11:17.433 --> 00:11:19.900
There must be some way you can remember.

212
00:11:26.833 --> 00:11:29.133
You can start today.

213
00:11:31.333 --> 00:11:33.366
I’m Clemont, the Gym Leader.

214
00:11:39.033 --> 00:11:42.166
Voice code entry complete. Ready to proceed.

215
00:11:44.100 --> 00:11:45.600
Ah! The voice code is,

216
00:11:45.666 --> 00:11:48.933
"You can start today. I’m Clemont, the Gym Leader".

217
00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:53.433
Code recognized. Master recognition battle mode activated.

218
00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.966
- All right!
- Way to go, Clemont!

219
00:11:56.033 --> 00:11:57.133
Pika.

220
00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:05.533
- Bunnelby, let’s go.
- Bunnelby!

221
00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.300
I will use this Pokémon.

222
00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:14.266
Heliolisk.

223
00:12:14.333 --> 00:12:16.900
Heliolisk.

224
00:12:16.966 --> 00:12:18.566
Heliolisk?

225
00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.766
Heliolisk, the Generator Pokémon

226
00:12:22.833 --> 00:12:25.133
and the evolved form of Helioptile.

227
00:12:25.199 --> 00:12:28.699
Heliolisk produces enough electricity to power a large building

228
00:12:28.766 --> 00:12:31.600
and recharges by spreading its frills.

229
00:12:31.666 --> 00:12:35.666
My reputation as a Gym Leader is resting on this battle.

230
00:12:35.733 --> 00:12:37.966
Heliolisk, give it all you’ve got!

231
00:12:38.033 --> 00:12:40.199
Heliolisk!

232
00:12:46.866 --> 00:12:49.000
Heliolisk, Thunderbolt.

233
00:12:49.066 --> 00:12:51.800
Clembot’s starting out using Thunderbolt

234
00:12:51.866 --> 00:12:54.000
and that’s just what I programmed it to do.

235
00:12:54.066 --> 00:12:55.500
Heliolisk!

236
00:12:55.566 --> 00:12:57.699
Bunnelby, use your ears to defend.

237
00:12:57.766 --> 00:12:59.766
Bunnelby!

238
00:13:01.633 --> 00:13:02.666
Amazing!

239
00:13:02.733 --> 00:13:05.066
Clemont did that back when I battled against him.

240
00:13:05.133 --> 00:13:06.666
Pika! Pika!

241
00:13:06.733 --> 00:13:10.966
- Bunnelby, Double Slap.
- Use Dragon Tail.

242
00:13:11.033 --> 00:13:13.466
Heliolisk!

243
00:13:13.533 --> 00:13:15.566
Bunnelby!

244
00:13:20.933 --> 00:13:22.699
Now, Bunnelby, Dig!

245
00:13:25.766 --> 00:13:27.966
Now use Bulldoze.

246
00:13:31.266 --> 00:13:33.699
Hold on, I never taught Heliolisk that move.

247
00:13:33.766 --> 00:13:36.300
Clembot taught it to Heliolisk on its own?

248
00:13:36.366 --> 00:13:38.833
- What?
- Use Dragon Tail.

249
00:13:44.133 --> 00:13:46.599
- Bunnelby, you okay?
- Bunnel!

250
00:13:46.666 --> 00:13:50.566
Having Heliolisk use Bulldoze like that was a surprise

251
00:13:50.633 --> 00:13:53.599
but it’ll be the same for them, dealing with a new move from us.

252
00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:57.666
Okay, now it’s our turn! Bunnelby, use Double Team!

253
00:13:57.733 --> 00:14:01.933
Bunnelby-by-by-by-by-by!

254
00:14:03.933 --> 00:14:07.266
- Heliolisk’s just standing there.
- I’ll bet this works.

255
00:14:07.333 --> 00:14:09.966
Bunnelby, Mud Shot!

256
00:14:10.033 --> 00:14:12.199
- Bunnel!
- Parabolic Charge.

257
00:14:12.266 --> 00:14:16.300
He! He! Heliolisk!

258
00:14:19.566 --> 00:14:21.633
-What kind of move is that?

259
00:14:21.699 --> 00:14:25.966
Parabolic Charge. It attacks all opponents in the area,

260
00:14:26.033 --> 00:14:28.566
while restoring energy at the same time.

261
00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.166
- Bunnelby?
- Bunnelby.

262
00:14:34.233 --> 00:14:36.666
- Use Thunderbolt.
- Heliolisk!

263
00:14:36.733 --> 00:14:39.199
Come on, Clemont, you have to win.

264
00:14:39.266 --> 00:14:41.433
Now, Bunnelby. Dig, let’s go!

265
00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:45.066
Bunnelbrrrrrrry!

266
00:14:45.133 --> 00:14:47.433
- Use Bulldoze!
- Oh!

267
00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.800
The same thing will happen all over again.

268
00:14:49.866 --> 00:14:51.966
- It’s all finished now.
- Na-na-na!

269
00:14:52.033 --> 00:14:56.133
No. No way! Hey, Clemont! Don’t give up till it’s over.

270
00:14:56.199 --> 00:15:00.666
Right. If there’s one thing I’ve learned from Ash, it’s thinking outside the box.

271
00:15:00.733 --> 00:15:05.066
Now. Bunnelby. Use Double Team while you’re still underground!

272
00:15:08.266 --> 00:15:09.833
- Huh?
- Now use Dig.

273
00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.066
Brrrr!

274
00:15:11.133 --> 00:15:15.133
Use Parabolic Charge.

275
00:15:20.166 --> 00:15:23.599
- All of them disappeared.
- Bunnelby?

276
00:15:23.666 --> 00:15:26.099
- Pikachu.
- Huh? Yeah!

277
00:15:27.333 --> 00:15:31.033
Brrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr!

278
00:15:31.099 --> 00:15:33.266
Error. Error.

279
00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:37.666
Let’s finish this up. Bunnelby, Mud Shot.

280
00:15:38.666 --> 00:15:42.500
Bunnelby!

281
00:15:45.733 --> 00:15:48.033
- Pika.
- Looks like it’s all over.

282
00:15:48.099 --> 00:15:51.766
- Bunnelby wins.
- Clemont was so great.

283
00:15:51.833 --> 00:15:52.900
Na-na-na!

284
00:15:54.199 --> 00:15:57.866
- oh, Heliolisk, are you okay?
- Heliolisk.

285
00:15:57.933 --> 00:16:01.133
Thank goodness, but I’m so sorry.

286
00:16:02.133 --> 00:16:05.266
- Huh?
- I recognize you now, sir.

287
00:16:05.333 --> 00:16:07.366
Welcome back to the Lumiose Gym.

288
00:16:07.433 --> 00:16:12.133
I’m glad to be back, Clembot.

289
00:16:12.199 --> 00:16:14.199
Because of my faulty programming,

290
00:16:14.266 --> 00:16:17.300
I realize I made a lot of trouble for you, too.

291
00:16:17.366 --> 00:16:20.099
It’s all my fault. I’m sorry.

292
00:16:20.166 --> 00:16:22.599
Hm?

293
00:16:23.599 --> 00:16:27.099
I think I’ll begin work on reprogramming you right now.

294
00:16:28.633 --> 00:16:30.666
First rule, be modest.

295
00:16:30.733 --> 00:16:34.099
It doesn’t matter how many badges a challenger has.

296
00:16:34.166 --> 00:16:38.599
Second rule, be kind, even while you’re being tough.

297
00:16:38.666 --> 00:16:42.400
And don’t forget to give the challenger constructive advice after the battle.

298
00:16:42.466 --> 00:16:45.000
And the third rule, be thoughtful.

299
00:16:45.066 --> 00:16:47.599
Try to help challengers grow their skills.

300
00:16:47.666 --> 00:16:50.199
These are rules every Gym Leader needs to follow.

301
00:16:57.966 --> 00:17:00.566
I’ve learned so very much from all of you.

302
00:17:00.633 --> 00:17:03.833
And I want to keep on learning. Right, Clembot?

303
00:17:04.833 --> 00:17:06.333
Well put, sir.

304
00:17:06.399 --> 00:17:10.066
Sorry. Now I’m feeling kind of embarrassed.

305
00:17:10.133 --> 00:17:13.266
Hey. I want to keep learning with you.

306
00:17:13.333 --> 00:17:16.333
-Me, too.

307
00:17:16.399 --> 00:17:19.899
- Clembot? Are we friends?
- Yes, Ash. We are friends.

308
00:17:19.966 --> 00:17:21.266
Me, too.

309
00:17:21.333 --> 00:17:24.333
-Mm.

310
00:17:24.399 --> 00:17:28.333
What? Your robot kicked you out of your own Gym?

311
00:17:28.399 --> 00:17:30.100
Hmm!

312
00:17:30.166 --> 00:17:32.700
Daddy, wait until you hear the end of the story.

313
00:17:32.766 --> 00:17:36.100
That’s how it was before, but everything’s all right now.

314
00:17:36.166 --> 00:17:38.700
It’s okay to leave it to Clembot to be the Gym Leader.

315
00:17:38.766 --> 00:17:40.600
Well, I sure hope that you’re right.

316
00:17:40.666 --> 00:17:43.800
So does that mean you’ll be coming by the house more often now?

317
00:17:43.866 --> 00:17:46.399
-Visit?

318
00:17:46.466 --> 00:17:48.266
Well, you see, the thing is...

319
00:17:48.333 --> 00:17:52.200
- Is there some sort of problem?
- Huh! Kind of... because...

320
00:17:52.266 --> 00:17:56.966
- Just tell him, Clemont, now!
- Uh-huh. Here’s the thing.

321
00:17:57.033 --> 00:18:00.100
- Huh.
- I’m going on a journey.

322
00:18:00.166 --> 00:18:03.399
Since I first met Ash, I’ve been gaining more and more courage

323
00:18:03.466 --> 00:18:05.166
the longer I travel around with him.

324
00:18:05.233 --> 00:18:07.133
- Courage, huh?
- That’s right.

325
00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:11.000
I’ve always been afraid to find the courage to try out new things,

326
00:18:11.066 --> 00:18:13.366
but now I’m feeling completely different.

327
00:18:13.433 --> 00:18:15.866
- Wow, Clemont!
- I’ve only been feeling this way

328
00:18:15.933 --> 00:18:18.399
for a short time, but I get it.

329
00:18:18.466 --> 00:18:21.800
I’ve experienced so much, so quickly.

330
00:18:21.866 --> 00:18:26.200
I’ve had fun, I’ve been sad, I’ve been happy and scared.

331
00:18:26.266 --> 00:18:28.866
That may not sound like such a big deal,

332
00:18:28.933 --> 00:18:31.600
but I’ve really started getting in touch with myself

333
00:18:31.666 --> 00:18:35.333
and that’s really, really important to me.

334
00:18:35.399 --> 00:18:38.533
Even if it’s only till Ash gets to the Kalos League,

335
00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.733
it’s really important that I travel with him there.

336
00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.800
Daddy, I want to go with Ash and Clemont too.

337
00:18:43.866 --> 00:18:45.700
- Na-na-na!
- Hm.

338
00:18:45.766 --> 00:18:47.833
- Dad?
- Please, Daddy. Please!

339
00:18:47.899 --> 00:18:51.700
- I’ll watch after Bonnie, I promise.
- We both promise.

340
00:18:51.766 --> 00:18:54.433
I give you my word that I will take care of the Gym

341
00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.533
and help out with the house as well.

342
00:18:56.600 --> 00:19:00.966
I’m just so....

343
00:19:01.033 --> 00:19:04.233
I’m just so proud and happy for you both! Hm!

344
00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:09.000
What a joy to have such great kids. I know I’ve told you this before.

345
00:19:09.066 --> 00:19:12.733
The most important thing in the world is to have real friends.

346
00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:15.566
As long as you have great friends like Ash and Serena,

347
00:19:15.633 --> 00:19:17.733
I’m not worried about a thing.

348
00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.800
All right! You can go.

349
00:19:20.866 --> 00:19:23.600
- Thanks so much, Dad!
- I love you, Daddy!

350
00:19:23.666 --> 00:19:25.833
Hm! And I love you, too.

351
00:19:25.899 --> 00:19:29.033
Now, Ash, Serena, promise me you’ll keep an eye on these two

352
00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.166
and make sure they stay out of trouble, okay?

353
00:19:31.233 --> 00:19:32.233
Yes, sir.

354
00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:35.866
All right! So for now, it’s time to celebrate

355
00:19:35.933 --> 00:19:37.966
Clemont and Bonnie’s new journey.

356
00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.633
- Nighty-night.
- Night, Bonnie.

357
00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:53.800
Hey, Ash, are you sorry you weren’t able to challenge the Lumiose Gym?

358
00:19:53.866 --> 00:19:56.466
Yeah, but back then you decided that challengers

359
00:19:56.533 --> 00:20:00.033
should be strong enough to have earned four Gym badges first, right?

360
00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:01.633
Huh? Well, yeah.

361
00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:05.600
Since that’s what you wanted, I’ll just come back when I’ve gotten four of them.

362
00:20:05.666 --> 00:20:08.800
- Pikachu.
- If that’s what you want.

363
00:20:08.866 --> 00:20:10.733
- One thing.
- Huh?

364
00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:13.633
I want the battle to be against you instead of Clembot.

365
00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:18.166
Huh? Deal! I’ll make sure I get stronger so I can give you a Gym battle

366
00:20:18.233 --> 00:20:21.133
you’ll never forget for the rest of your life.

367
00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:25.300
- That sounds good to me.
- Great. That’s what we’ll do.

368
00:20:26.566 --> 00:20:29.033
And so, with renewed determination,

369
00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:33.133
Ash, Clemont, Serena and Bonnie begin their journey together.

370
00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:38.133
All kinds of new and exciting adventures await them from here on...

371
00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:41.399
All right. What do you say we go?

372
00:20:41.466 --> 00:20:44.466
Blaziken!

373
00:20:44.533 --> 00:20:47.500
..as the journey continues.
